<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">More Than Meets the Eye? Uncovering the Reasoning-Planning Disconnect in Training Vision-Language Driving Models</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
